    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "info",
      "text": "**SWITCH** compares one value with exact cases, using the pattern `=SWITCH(value,case1,result1,case2,result2,default)`. Add a default result for values with no match; it is clearer than IFS when every test checks the same cell for an exact value."
    },
